{"thread":{"threadID":4183,"boardID":166,"topic":"MG Server: Munition Plugin","time":1487100586,"userID":2356,"username":"DerXXLMario","lastPostTime":1487214838,"lastPoster":"Nachtfrische","replies":5,"views":401,"attachments":3,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":1,"cumulativeLikes":4},"tags":[{"tagID":974,"name":"CS GO"},{"tagID":160,"name":"Minigame"},{"tagID":166,"name":"plugin"}],"posts":[{"postID":61819,"threadID":4183,"userID":2356,"username":"DerXXLMario","subject":"MG Server: Munition Plugin","time":1487100586,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[{"attachmentID":941,"objectID":61819,"filename":"CS GO_Dream 3.jpg","filesize":183777,"fileType":"image/jpeg","isImage":1,"width":1280,"height":720,"downloads":32,"uploadTime":1487099453},{"attachmentID":942,"objectID":61819,"filename":"AK47 leer.jpg","filesize":176533,"fileType":"image/jpeg","isImage":1,"width":1280,"height":720,"downloads":30,"uploadTime":1487099544},{"attachmentID":943,"objectID":61819,"filename":"AK47.jpg","filesize":291988,"fileType":"image/jpeg","isImage":1,"width":1280,"height":720,"downloads":30,"uploadTime":1487099577}],"cumulativeLikes":4,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":54,"username":"Craxto","time":1487102567,"value":1},{"userID":1954,"username":"wickedy","time":1487104323,"value":1},{"userID":2318,"username":"PEYZO","time":1487113261,"value":1},{"userID":2408,"username":"KlitschkoS","time":1487166039,"value":1},{"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","time":1487214893,"value":1},{"userID":1983,"username":"Runningcore","time":1487114458,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hallo,<br>Es geht mal wieder um den Minigame Server. Ganz oft,<br>gerade bei der Map mg_warmcup_headshot, kommt es oft dazu, dass die Munition leer geht...<br>Dann fängt man logischerweise an zu knifen und es wird wieder gemeckert. <span class=\"archive-emoji\">🤬</span> <br><span class=\"metacode-inline\"></span><br>Mein Vorschlag:<br>Habe gegoogelt, und ein Plugin gefunden was sich sm_replen.smx nennt<br>und dieses Problem fixt. Also wenn man keine Munition mehr hat (0/0) ladet man auf einmal<br>nach und da steht: (30/60), z. B. bei der AK47.<br><span class=\"metacode-inline\"></span><br>Danach ladet die Waffe nach:<br><span class=\"metacode-inline\"></span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Installation:<br>Wie man es auf dem Server draufladet, denke ich wisst<br>ihr selber, es ist übrigens ein .smx Datei.<br>Die cvars müssen auch nicht geändert werden (also musste ich bei meinem Offline-Server nicht).<br>Downloadlink: <a href=\"https://forums.alliedmods.net/showthread.php?p=1482151?p=1482151\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Würde mich auf jeden Fall freuen, wenn ihr die Idee umsetzt.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":61831,"threadID":4183,"userID":1983,"username":"Runningcore","subject":"","time":1487114399,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>sv_infinite_ammo <strong>2</strong>?</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":61834,"threadID":4183,"userID":2185,"username":"Ibo107","subject":"","time":1487126059,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>die Idee finde ich ganz gut von dir das Problem hatte ich auch schon mal  und würde es begrüssen wenn das rein kommt</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":61863,"threadID":4183,"userID":2356,"username":"DerXXLMario","subject":"","time":1487165704,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p><strong><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1983-runningcore/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Runningcore</a></strong></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Also ich habe diesen Befehl mal ausgetestet, und gemerkt das es ihn tatsächlich gibt. Trotzdem würde ich das Plugin bevorzugen, weil ich gemerkt habe, dass dieser Befehl manchmal ziemlich bugt. Also manchmal bekommt man nach dem Nachladen nicht (30/60), sondern (1/89). Ich denke, es liegt daran, weil die Maps schon versuchen, der Waffe mehr Munition zu verleihen.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":61864,"threadID":4183,"userID":2408,"username":"KlitschkoS","subject":"","time":1487166056,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ich fände es ne nice idee</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":61886,"threadID":4183,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"","time":1487214838,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2356,"username":"DerXXLMario","time":1487223207,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>Runningcore</strong></cite><p>sv_infinite_ammo <strong>2</strong>?<br></p></blockquote><p>Das hat leider nicht funktioniert, da die Map wohl auch versucht hat die Munition aufzufüllen. Man hatte also unendlich Munition, aber immer nur eine Kugel im Magazin nach dem Nachladen.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Das Plugin von <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2356-derxxlmario/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@DerXXLMario</a> hat funktioniert und wurde umgesetzt, siehe hier: <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?thread/4188\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a></p>","polls":[]}]}